As for layer 6 there isnt a specifc video for this because this is collasped into layer 7.

Quick description what layer 6 does: 

- Translation - Converts data from netwokr format to application format (e.g. EBCDIC to ASCII)
- Encryption/Decryption - This is where TLS/SSL live on the OSI model
- Compression - Reduces the size of the data before it reaches the transportt layer

More infomation will be on layer 7 (Application)
